  "body": "### Summary\nLOT-028 (#56) needs one Alertes Qualitaÿ RSS item whose reporter comment (`<b>X (initiateur)</b> : comment`) contains an HTML entity (`&quot;`, `&#039;`, `&amp;`, `&lt;`), so the comment decoding is tested on evidence. The feed captured in #133 (`T01`, PR #435) had entities in topic titles only, none in a comment.\n\n### Scope\n- Re-read `https://aq.super-h.fr/rss.php` (anonymous GET) when such an item is live; the anonymizer keeps entities while masking the words.\n- Entities inside an initiator pseudo cannot survive anonymization (aliased to `userN`); out of scope.\n- Read-only. If no such item appears, say so here.\n\n### Wanted by\nLOT-028 (#56) (pending capture in its spec).\n\nRefs #133\n",
